<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ DRAW FIRST TEST WITH ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ DRAW FIRST TEST WITH ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand saved the first cricket test against England, which ended in a draw on Tuesday after they reached 248 for nine in their second innings.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 390. Second innings 248 for nine wickets (N. Astle 102 not out)</p>
<p>England first innings 521 (A. Stewart 173, M. Atherton 83, G. Thorpe 119, D.Cork 59).</p>
